22
00:02:16.061 --> 00:02:17.211
Kite!

23
00:02:18.014 --> 00:02:23.133
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:23.183 --> 00:02:24.333
Car!

25
00:02:25.315 --> 00:02:32.881
Think and answer. What toy do you like to play with?

26
